"subs": [
{
"t": 0.15,
"dur": 4.419,
"text": "The boss mourns his own worker on his knees. Every night at three a.m."
},
{
"t": 4.869,
"dur": 1.663,
"text": "I'll take your schedule."
},
{
"t": 6.932,
"dur": 7.169,
"text": "Family has to mourn. Every night at three a.m., wrap on a mourning scarf and kneel before Loc's picture. Like his son."
},
{
"t": 14.35,
"dur": 3.454,
"text": "Meet clients during the day. Can't take off the mourning scarf."
},
{
"t": 18.055,
"dur": 6.758,
"text": "Whenever he sleeps through it, the time clock prints his name by itself. By morning, the factory doors are covered in it."
},
{
"t": 25.062,
"dur": 0.984,
"text": "When does this end?"
},
{
"t": 26.446,
"dur": 6.899,
"text": "When the paperwork is right. If it's still wrong after forty-nine days, I'll check you in again. That time, no badge needed."
},
{
"t": 34.145,
"dur": 4.053,
"text": "Did the boss fix the paperwork? Full story on the channel. Follow along."
}
],
